{
  "corpus_version": "2026-09-16-v1",
  "description": "面向教学与检索评测的车辆诊断摘要。内容为基于公开技术资料重新整理的中文摘要，不替代车型维修手册。",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor:section:1",
      "doc_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor",
      "title": "空气质量流量传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "功能与安装位置",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/uk/technical/sensors-and-actuators/check-air-mass-sensor/",
      "text": "空气质量流量传感器（MAF）测量发动机吸入的空气质量，发动机控制单元据此计算喷油量。它通常安装在空气滤清器壳体与进气歧管之间的进气管路中。MAF 与 MAP 都描述进气负荷，但测量对象和诊断方法不同，不能仅凭一个数值互相替代。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "air_intake",
      "pid_tags": ["MAF"],
      "dtc_codes": ["P0100", "P0101", "P0102", "P0103", "P0104"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor:section:2",
      "doc_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor",
      "title": "空气质量流量传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "常见故障表现",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/uk/technical/sensors-and-actuators/check-air-mass-sensor/",
      "text": "MAF 故障可能使发动机熄火、控制单元进入应急运行模式或点亮发动机故障灯。这些表现并不只由 MAF 引起，应结合故障码、进气泄漏检查、实时流量和发动机工况判断。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "air_intake",
      "pid_tags": ["MAF"],
      "dtc_codes": ["P0100", "P0101", "P0102", "P0103", "P0104"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor:section:3",
      "doc_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor",
      "title": "空气质量流量传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "失效原因",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/uk/technical/sensors-and-actuators/check-air-mass-sensor/",
      "text": "MAF 失效原因包括插头接触不良、测量元件损坏、振动或事故造成的机械损伤，以及测量元件脱离支架。诊断时还应排除空气滤清器之后的进气泄漏，因为泄漏会造成类似的混合气异常。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "air_intake",
      "pid_tags": ["MAF"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor:section:4",
      "doc_id": "hella-air-mass-sensor",
      "title": "空气质量流量传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "检查步骤",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/uk/technical/sensors-and-actuators/check-air-mass-sensor/",
      "text": "MAF 检查顺序：读取故障码和冻结帧；检查插头是否牢固、端子是否腐蚀；检查壳体及测量元件；按电路图验证供电、搭铁和信号；断电后检查控制单元至传感器线束导通。HELLA 示例中导通电阻约为 0 欧姆，实际阈值必须以车型维修资料为准。",
      "safety_notes": ["测量电阻前应按维修资料断电，禁止用不适当的探针损坏端子。"],
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "air_intake",
      "pid_tags": ["MAF"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coolant-temperature-sensor:function",
      "doc_id": "hella-coolant-temperature-sensor",
      "title": "冷却液温度传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "功能与 NTC 特性",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-coolant-temperature-sensor/",
      "text": "冷却液温度传感器把发动机温度提供给控制单元，用于修正喷油时间和点火角。常见元件为 NTC 热敏电阻：温度上升时电阻下降。ECT 数据异常既可能来自传感器，也可能来自线路、冷却系统或节温器。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "coolant_temperature",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coolant-temperature-sensor:symptoms",
      "doc_id": "hella-coolant-temperature-sensor",
      "title": "冷却液温度传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "故障表现",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-coolant-temperature-sensor/",
      "text": "冷却液温度信号错误可能表现为怠速偏高、油耗增加、冷启动或热启动困难。仪表显示温度异常时，先用诊断仪读取 ECT 实时值，并与环境温度、实际发动机温度和其他温度传感器进行合理性对比。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "coolant_temperature",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coolant-temperature-sensor:causes",
      "doc_id": "hella-coolant-temperature-sensor",
      "title": "冷却液温度传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "可能原因",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-coolant-temperature-sensor/",
      "text": "ECT 相关故障可能来自线束断路、对正极或搭铁短路、插头腐蚀、传感器输出不可信，也可能是节温器故障导致发动机长期达不到最低工作温度。故障码只限定检测到的异常，不等于已经确认要更换传感器。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "coolant_temperature",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coolant-temperature-sensor:checks",
      "doc_id": "hella-coolant-temperature-sensor",
      "title": "冷却液温度传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "电气检查",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-coolant-temperature-sensor/",
      "text": "ECT 检查包括读取故障存储、检查插头和腐蚀、按温度测量传感器电阻、验证线束导通及供电。HELLA 给出的示例是 25°C 时约 2–6 kΩ、80°C 时约 300 Ω、供电约 5 V；这些只是示例，必须查对应车型特性曲线和电路图。",
      "safety_notes": ["冷却系统高温高压时不要直接打开膨胀罐或散热器盖。"],
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "coolant_temperature",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "cooling-system:initial-checks",
      "doc_id": "hella-cooling-system-check",
      "title": "发动机冷却系统检查",
      "section_title": "初始检查",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-cooling-system/cooling-system-check/",
      "text": "冷却系统初检应覆盖冷却液液位、污染和防冻能力，软管与接头泄漏，驱动皮带状态及张紧度。先处理明显的液位不足或泄漏，再进入传感器、风扇、节温器和循环能力诊断。",
      "safety_notes": ["发动机高温时冷却系统可能带压，应冷却后按维修规程操作。"],
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "cooling_system",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "cooling-system:overheat-validation",
      "doc_id": "hella-cooling-system-check",
      "title": "发动机冷却系统检查",
      "section_title": "过热信号验证",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-cooling-system/cooling-system-check/",
      "text": "遇到过热报警先验证温度是否真实：比较仪表、诊断仪 ECT、冷机环境温度以及可安全取得的外部温度测量。若信号不合理，优先检查温度传感器和线路；若温度确实偏高，再检查散热气流与冷却液循环。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "cooling_system",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "cooling-system:fan-thermostat",
      "doc_id": "hella-cooling-system-check",
      "title": "发动机冷却系统检查",
      "section_title": "风扇与节温器",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-cooling-system/cooling-system-check/",
      "text": "真实过热时检查散热器表面是否堵塞、冷却风扇能否按条件启动、节温器能否开启。发动机长期升温慢或达不到工作温度时，则重点考虑节温器卡在开启位置、风扇持续运转或 ECT 信号错误。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "cooling_system",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "cooling-system:circulation",
      "doc_id": "hella-cooling-system-check",
      "title": "发动机冷却系统检查",
      "section_title": "循环能力",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-cooling-system/cooling-system-check/",
      "text": "风扇和节温器正常但仍过热时，检查散热器进出口温差和流量、水泵叶轮及驱动、系统排气，以及压力盖或膨胀罐阀门。温差只能作为线索，应结合车型规定和完整工况判断。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "cooling_system",
      "pid_tags": ["ECT"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "lambda-sensor:function",
      "doc_id": "hella-lambda-sensor",
      "title": "氧传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "功能与安装位置",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-lambda-sensor/",
      "text": "氧传感器（Lambda sensor）测量排气中的残余氧，控制单元利用信号调节空燃比。上游传感器主要参与混合气闭环控制，下游传感器主要用于监测催化转换器效率，二者角色不能混淆。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "oxygen_sensor",
      "pid_tags": ["O2_B1S1", "O2_B1S2", "LAMBDA"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "lambda-sensor:narrowband-signal",
      "doc_id": "hella-lambda-sensor",
      "title": "氧传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "窄带信号解释",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-lambda-sensor/",
      "text": "传统窄带氧传感器在达到工作温度后，稀混合气信号约接近 0.1 V，浓混合气约接近 0.9 V；汽油理论空燃比约 14.7:1，对应 Lambda 1。宽带传感器信号形式不同，不能直接套用窄带电压阈值。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "oxygen_sensor",
      "pid_tags": ["O2_B1S1", "LAMBDA"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "lambda-sensor:symptoms-causes",
      "doc_id": "hella-lambda-sensor",
      "title": "氧传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "症状与原因",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-lambda-sensor/",
      "text": "氧传感器异常可能伴随油耗升高、动力下降、排放异常、故障灯和相关故障码。原因可包括线路短路、供电或搭铁故障、过热、沉积污染、机械损伤，以及含铅燃油或不适当添加剂。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "oxygen_sensor",
      "pid_tags": ["O2_B1S1", "O2_B1S2", "LAMBDA"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "lambda-sensor:checks",
      "doc_id": "hella-lambda-sensor",
      "title": "氧传感器诊断",
      "section_title": "检查步骤",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/sensors-and-actuators/test-lambda-sensor/",
      "text": "检查氧传感器时先目视检查线束、插头和污染，再排查传感器前方排气泄漏。确认发动机与传感器达到工作温度后，使用诊断仪、示波器或高输入阻抗仪表观察响应；同时参考燃油修正，避免把混合气根因误判成传感器损坏。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "oxygen_sensor",
      "pid_tags": ["O2_B1S1", "O2_B1S2", "STFT_B1", "LTFT_B1"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "charging-system:function",
      "doc_id": "hella-charging-system",
      "title": "车辆充电系统诊断",
      "section_title": "系统职责",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-electronics-and-electrics/starting-and-charging-system/service-work-on-the-charging-system/",
      "text": "发动机运转时，发电机为用电设备供电并给蓄电池充电。充电问题不只等于发电机损坏，还可能来自蓄电池、皮带和张紧器、线缆连接、搭铁、调节器或智能充电控制策略。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "charging_system",
      "pid_tags": ["CONTROL_MODULE_VOLTAGE"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "charging-system:battery-precheck",
      "doc_id": "hella-charging-system",
      "title": "车辆充电系统诊断",
      "section_title": "蓄电池预检",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-electronics-and-electrics/starting-and-charging-system/service-work-on-the-charging-system/",
      "text": "诊断充电系统前先检查蓄电池状态、端子紧固与腐蚀。HELLA 指南给出的静置开路电压参考范围为 12.4–13.2 V，低于 12.4 V 时建议先充电再复测；蓄电池类型、温度和静置时间会影响判断。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "charging_system",
      "pid_tags": ["CONTROL_MODULE_VOLTAGE"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "charging-system:running-test",
      "doc_id": "hella-charging-system",
      "title": "车辆充电系统诊断",
      "section_title": "运行电压与压降",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/en/technical/car-electronics-and-electrics/starting-and-charging-system/service-work-on-the-charging-system/",
      "text": "传统系统可在约 2000–2500 rpm 和负载下检查充电电压与线路压降。HELLA 示例设定值约 13.7–15 V、负载后下降不应超过约 0.5 V；智能充电车辆会主动改变电压，因此最终必须按车型、蓄电池类型和工况规范判断。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "charging_system",
      "pid_tags": ["RPM", "CONTROL_MODULE_VOLTAGE"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "charging-system:symptoms-safety",
      "doc_id": "hella-alternator-check",
      "title": "车辆充电系统诊断",
      "section_title": "症状与安全边界",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/us/technical/car-electronics-and-electrics/starting-and-charging-system/checking-the-alternator/",
      "text": "充电系统故障可表现为充电警告灯、启动困难、蓄电池过热、灯光亮度随转速变化或灯泡频繁损坏。不要在发动机运行时断开蓄电池，也不要短接发电机端子；这种旧式测试可能损坏现代车辆电子系统。",
      "safety_notes": ["发动机运行时禁止断开蓄电池或短接发电机端子。"],
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "charging_system",
      "pid_tags": ["RPM", "CONTROL_MODULE_VOLTAGE"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "throttle-position:function",
      "doc_id": "hella-throttle-potentiometer",
      "title": "节气门位置诊断",
      "section_title": "功能",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/uk/technical/sensors-and-actuators/throttle-potentiometer/",
      "text": "节气门位置传感器安装在节气门轴附近，用于向控制单元报告节气门开度。控制单元结合该信号和其他负荷信息计算喷油及控制策略。TPS 百分比、加速踏板位置和电子节气门执行器位置是相关但不同的信号。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "throttle",
      "pid_tags": ["THROTTLE_POSITION"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "throttle-position:checks",
      "doc_id": "hella-throttle-potentiometer",
      "title": "节气门位置诊断",
      "section_title": "合理性检查",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/techworld/uk/technical/sensors-and-actuators/throttle-potentiometer/",
      "text": "节气门相关故障应检查插头、供电、搭铁和信号变化是否平滑，并比较踏板请求、目标开度和实际开度。电子节气门出现卡滞或信号不一致时可能进入受限模式；清洗或更换后是否需要学习，应按车型维修程序执行。",
      "source_name": "HELLA Tech World",
      "topic": "throttle",
      "pid_tags": ["THROTTLE_POSITION"],
      "dtc_codes": ["P2100", "P2101", "P2111", "P2112"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "obd-dtc:meaning",
      "doc_id": "epa-obd-inspection",
      "title": "OBD-II 故障码解释",
      "section_title": "故障码不是零件结论",
      "source_url": "https://www.epa.gov/sites/default/files/2018-02/documents/table_e_ut_section_x_vehicle_inspection_and_maintenance_program.pdf",
      "text": "OBD-II 在检测到排放相关异常时可点亮 MIL，并保存诊断故障码。DTC 描述控制系统检测到的异常电路或运行条件，不直接证明某个零件已损坏；正确流程是结合报码条件、冻结帧、实时数据、电路检查和维修资料确认根因。",
      "source_name": "US EPA",
      "topic": "obd_dtc"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "obd-dtc:families",
      "doc_id": "hella-obd-p-codes",
      "title": "OBD-II 故障码解释",
      "section_title": "进气与混合气报码族",
      "source_url": "https://www.hella.com/hotsecdocs/OBDII/dtc_db/codelists/en_p-codes.htm",
      "text": "P0100–P0104 通常属于 MAF 电路或信号范围问题；P0171/P0174 表示对应气缸列混合气过稀，P0172/P0175 表示过浓。精确报码有助于词法检索，但仍需结合车型定义和冻结帧，不能只按代码表更换部件。",
      "source_name": "HELLA",
      "topic": "obd_dtc",
      "pid_tags": ["MAF", "STFT_B1", "LTFT_B1"],
      "dtc_codes": ["P0100", "P0101", "P0102", "P0103", "P0104", "P0171", "P0172", "P0174", "P0175"]
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "fuel-trim:meaning",
      "doc_id": "bosch-obd-manual",
      "title": "燃油修正诊断",
      "section_title": "STFT 与 LTFT",
      "source_url": "https://cdr.boschdiagnostics.com/pro/sites/pro/files/tech_1a_global_obd_ii_operators_manual.pdf",
      "text": "短期燃油修正 STFT 表示控制单元根据氧传感器反馈进行的快速修正，长期燃油修正 LTFT 表示学习到的持续修正。正值通常表示控制单元增加燃油，负值通常表示减少燃油；应结合闭环状态、转速和负荷观察，单个瞬时值不能直接定故障。",
